Follow AGENTS.md: commands, architecture rules and conventions. Before writing React Native code, read
`.claude/skills/react-native-best-practices/SKILL.md` and the reference it points to for the task. For
navigation use `.claude/skills/react-navigation/SKILL.md`; for tests `.claude/skills/react-native-testing/SKILL.md`.
Where a skill and AGENTS.md disagree, AGENTS.md wins.
